{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45137","headline":"酬元主簿子球别赠 · 皎然","name":"酬元主簿子球别赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人方远适，访我陈别情。\n此夜偶禅室，一言了无生。\n览君缄中宝，如搴清玉瑛。\n胡爲蕴高价，岁晚徒营营。\n辞秩贫且病，何人见艰贞。\n出无黄金橐，空歌白苎行。\n威迟策驽马，独望故关树。\n渺渺千里心，春风起中路。\n近闻新拜命，鸾凤犹栖棘。\n劝君寄一枝，且养冥冥翼。\n甘泉多竹花，明年待君食。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}